  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multiprofile setups with imagenet_vit_l image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_025) achieve the highest accuracy so far (0.635). This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 (a more sophisticated encoder) in this high-performing configuration improves accuracy further. It isolates the effect of RNA representation while keeping other critical components (image encoder, aggregation, fusion) consistent, maximizing exploitation of the current promising direction."
